**Known for**: cock.li

Vincent is the owner of the "cock.li" email provider, which provides
intentionally "edgy" email addresses to its users and targets bigots and
extremists who would be marginalized elsewhere with its free speech absolutist
principles. The domain names available include options such as "@n\*gge.rs" and
"@rape.lol", as well as a number of more covert domain names such as
"@airmail.cc" which are more likely to fly under the radar.
